<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel Marine net profit down 42.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Keppel Marine net profit down 42.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to Dec 31 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     15.18  vs  26.56</p>
<p>Group shares (cents)  8.30  vs  14.50  </p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	3.50  vs   3.50</p>
<p>    Turnover		144.04  vs 176.05</p>
<p>    Other income	    3.58  vs   3.20</p>
<p>    Interest expense	1.95  vs   2.05</p>
<p>    Pretax		    7.04  vs  17.26</p>
<p>    Associates	     11.28  vs  11.10</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.54  vs   2.31</p>
<p>    Minorities	     (0.60) vs   0.52</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	 7.30* vs   2.81</p>
<p>* Extraordinary items comprise mainly provision for closure of businesses in subsidiaries.</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Keppel Marine Industries Ltd, formerly known as Singmarine Industries Ltd.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
